WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.542 --> 00:00:07.789
Maya moved to the cloud, but her friends still send letters to the old mailbox on the ground!

3
00:00:08.796 --> 00:00:12.063
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:13.069 --> 00:00:15.593
This is Episode 77.

5
00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:18.415
Meet the mail-chute.

6
00:00:19.422 --> 00:00:24.728
Its pipe reaches down from the cloud, and its flap sits right where the old mailbox was.

7
00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:28.152
Same flap, same way.

8
00:00:29.159 --> 00:00:32.294
Friends drop a letter in, just like always.

9
00:00:33.301 --> 00:00:34.540
Whoosh!

10
00:00:35.546 --> 00:00:37.798
It lands in the cloud cubby.

11
00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:41.329
Nobody has to learn anything new.

12
00:00:42.335 --> 00:00:45.318
That is the AWS Transfer Family.

13
00:00:46.324 --> 00:00:50.051
Friends send files the old way, and they land in the cloud.

14
00:00:51.058 --> 00:00:53.109
Now you know the mail-chute!

15
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

